  "native_contract": {
    "drawable_getter": "SPen::AirBrushPenStrokeDrawableGL::getColor(), AirBrushPen DSO RVA 0x24c94; reads stored source ARGB then multiplies source alpha byte as f32 by 50.0f, divides by 255.0f, FCVTZS truncates toward zero, clamps output alpha to [3,50], and preserves low 24 RGB bits",
    "limits": "The 256-result sweep invokes native SetColor and getColor on the drawable selected by an actual explicit-empty Model->Drawing route. Ten separate complete Drawing routes confirm each returned color at RTV1 SetPenData. This records native color conversion, not GPU pixels, blending, or user/app lifecycle.",
    "setter": "SPen::Pen::SetColor(int), PenCommon RVA 0x4602c: raw W1 store at this+28; getter RVA 0x4603c loads this+28"
  },
